  14:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *   @brief   This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *            of the DAC component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *          
