  18:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *            of the DAC component of the Stellar Motor Control:
  19:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *             + Set up the DAC outputs
  20:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *             + get the current DAC channel selected output.
  21:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *             + Set the value of the "User DAC channel".
  22:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** *             + get the value of the "User DAC channel".
  23:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c **** */
