  49:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   * @brief  Set up the DAC outputs. The selected
  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   *         variables will be provided in the related output channels after next
  51:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   *         DACExec.
  52:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   * @param  user interface handle.
  53:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   * @param  bChannel the DAC channel to be programmed. It must be one of the
  54:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   *         exported channels Ex. DAC_CH0.
  55:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   * @param  bVariable the variables to be provided in out through the selected
  56:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   *         channel. It must be one of the exported UI register Ex.
  57:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   *         MC_PROTOCOL_REG_I_A.
  58:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   * @retval none.
  59:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_common_ui.c ****   */
